 ## Background
-The construction of octrees for point clouds is a foundational technique in spatial indexing for rendering. The specific implementation details regarding `MAX_LEAF_OBJECTS` and CPU culling aggregation are documented in unofficial repositories [S1, unofficial]. The application of octrees to curvilinear volumes for volume rendering was introduced in research addressing interpolation errors in irregular sampling [S2].
